### 2. What You Can Deduct
Even with the standard deduction, you can still take "above-the-line" deductions and business deductions:

*   **Home Office Deduction (Against 1099 Income):** Because you have 1099 self-employment income and an exclusive-use home office, you can deduct this on Schedule C. 
